193	// ── Drift / reference-integrity validation ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
194	// Helpers to check that generated output stays faithful to the token IR: no references to tokens
195	// that don't exist (drift vs the source), and no `var()` refs left undefined within a stylesheet.
